## Context
Take top 3 configurations from Sweep 2. Apply 5 verification modes:
unverified, self, cross, web, tool. 3 runs each. ~45 calls. Budget ~$10-25.

## Key question
What is the marginal cost of going from "AI says 120 plants" to
"120 plants with traceable provenance"?

## Exit criteria
- 45 runs completed and scored
- Cost-accuracy tradeoff table for verification modes
